# Sidecar ignore file for sdk/js/Dockerfile.
#
# A `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` REPLACES the repository root `.dockerignore`
# entirely for this build — it does not merge with it. That is the point: the
# root file excludes `sdk`, so a build using the repository root as its context
# cannot see the package it exists to test, and the failure reads as a missing
# directory rather than as an ignore rule.
#
# So this file starts from "exclude everything" and admits exactly the paths
# the image needs.
*

!sdk/js/package.json
!sdk/js/pnpm-lock.yaml
!sdk/js/pnpm-workspace.yaml

# The pre-compiled engine addon, built by `make napi`. Gitignored, and the root
# ignore file never mentioned it because nothing else needs it.
!dist/napi/local
